        "created_at": "2013-12-04T11:23:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Will Overdrive be useless when using his alt? I mean, Mister Fixer is often complained about as being one of the less useful heroes, and Overdrive is arguably one of his best cards. Can Bitter Strike be used twice with Overdrive?</p><p>On the other hand, Expatriette looks like she's going to get a major boost from Aim... Using it alongside Unload or Assault Rifle seems like it could be really useful, especially with characters like Arget Adept or WW2 Legacy to give her extra powers.</p>",
